WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
What if a recording felt different before you heard it?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In a 2025 experiment, researchers varied the procedures and their names.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Calling a procedure hypnosis raised listeners' expectations.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The description also affected reports of hypnotic depth.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
That is not proof that any commercial recording works.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Check what is actually offered and what was actually tested.
